{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111658","id":2915261183,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6tw1r_","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111658","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111658.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111658.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111658","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111658/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111658/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111658/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1f7e7de82b76ebbf301720c542564b73bec9ccd6","number":111658,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix D3D12 rendering device driver returning pointers to internal types for `get_resource_native_handle` instead of proper D3D12 primitives","user":{"login":"brycehutchings","id":5100250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDAyNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5100250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings","html_url":"https://github.com/brycehutchings","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I am working on a project to display texture resources in Godot that are shared from another process. To do this I require interop with the underlying rendering primitives (e.g. ID3D12Device/VkLogicalDevice, ID3D12CommandQueue/VkQueue, ID3D12Resource/VkImage). I found with D3D12 that the wrong memory addresses were being returned by RenderingDevice::get_driver_resource in two cases:\r\n\r\n* When querying for `DRIVER_RESOURCE_COMMAND_QUEUE`, a pointer to an internal structure (`CommandQueueInfo *`) rather than the `ID3D12CommandQueue *` pointer was being returned.\r\n* When querying for `DRIVER_RESOURCE_TEXTURE`, a pointer to an internal structure was being returned (`(uint64_t)tex_info->main_texture` is a `TextureInfo *`). Instead, this should be returning the `ID3D12Resource *` pointer. In fact, looking back in the history, I can see that this is what was done before a big refactor to avoid code duplication between D3D12 and VK (See the old definition of `texture_get_native_handle` in rendering_device_d3d12.cpp - #83452).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mj